# @gomboc-ai/gomboc-node-sdk is published to GitHub Packages (private registry).
# Install requires a GitHub token with `read:packages` scope, exported as GITHUB_TOKEN
# (or NODE_AUTH_TOKEN). Then run `npm install` in this directory.
@gomboc-ai:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${GITHUB_TOKEN}
